Latn-x-wylie">rin po che</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gnas nang pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khams pa se bo</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mtshur phu ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">grub thob rnam 'byor</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhwa nag pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge 'phel</persName><birth notBefore="1110-01-01" notAfter="1110-12-31">1110</birth><death notBefore="1193-01-01" notAfter="1193-12-31">1193</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1400</idno><idno type="APIS">3855</idno><note type="comment">First Karmapa.&#13;
His birth name was dGe 'phel ([Y6NGTTC6]: 24). His alternative names and epithets are listed in [Y6NGTTC6]: 5 and 27, which also lists the main information on his life found in early sources.&#13;
Dus gsum mkhyen pa (ID:3855), Sho sgom (ID:3857), and Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856) are known as the "grub thob mi gsum" and as the "khams pa mi gsum." According to Dus gsum mkhyen pa'i rnam thar in Si tu Chos kyi 'byung gnas's Karma kam tshang gser 'phreng (cited in [I58Z22ET]: 408, n. 42), Dus gsum mkhyen became known as one of the "khams pa mi gsum" during his stays in gSang phu (ID:4332) (gsang phur yang bzhugs te | khams pa mi gsum du grags |).</note></person><person xml:id="person3860"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">glang lung pa brtson 'grus gzhon nu</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གླང་ལུང་པ་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་གཞོན་ནུ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin po che glang lung pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin chen glang lung pa</persName><birth notBefore="1123-01-01" notAfter="1123-12-31">1123</birth><death notBefore="1193-01-01" notAfter="1193-12-31">1193</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3722</idno><idno type="APIS">3860</idno><note type="comment">Dates according to [Q922IUFM]: 24. He received an oral tradition of Atiśa from Nam mkha' rdo rje, and put it into writing in the form of a lam rim treatise, and received another oral tradition traced to rNal 'byor pa ([Q922IUFM]: 24).</note></person><person xml:id="person3863"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jad pa gzhon nu byang chub</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">འཇད་པ་གཞོན་ནུ་བྱང་ཆུབ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jad pa gzhon byang</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jam dpal gzhon nu byang chub</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gzhon nu byang chub skyabs</persName><birth notBefore="1140-01-01" notAfter="1160-12-31">after 1140 before 1160</birth><death notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1220-12-31">after 1200 before 1220</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10015</idno><idno type="APIS">3863</idno></person><person xml:id="person3868"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pa tshab nyi ma grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">པ་ཚབ་ཉི་མ་གྲགས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pa tshab lo tsA ba nyi ma grags pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang pa tshab nyi ma grags</persName><birth notBefore="1055-01-01" notAfter="1055-12-31">1055</birth><death notBefore="1141-01-01">after 1141</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P5651</idno><idno type="APIS">3868</idno><note type="comment">Proposed dates: c. 1070-1145.</note></person><person xml:id="person3869"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang sha ra ba yon tan grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཞང་ཤ་ར་བ་ཡོན་ཏན་གྲགས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shar ra ba yon tan grags</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shar ba pa yon tan grags</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon shar ba pa stag dur ba</persName><birth notBefore="1070-01-01" notAfter="1070-12-31">1070</birth><death notBefore="1141-01-01" notAfter="1141-12-31">1141</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1405</idno><idno type="APIS">3869</idno></person><person xml:id="person3870"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang thang sag pa ye shes 'byung gnas</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཞང་ཐང་སག་པ་ཡེ་ཤེས་འབྱུང་གནས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang 'byung gnas ye shes</persName><birth notBefore="1000-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1000 before 1100</birth><death notBefore="1065-01-01" notAfter="1180-12-31">after 1065 before 1180</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4455</idno><idno t